description = "Extends its legs extra long and strides into the space of the ally within {reach_cells} cells with the most Celerity, looming over it for {duration} seconds. The ally gains {celerity_share%} of Frame's Celerity, and whenever it attacks, Frame attacks its target too. Frame makes no attacks of its own and gains no Charge meanwhile."
